  "text": "Louis Vincent’s studio practice is defined by a profound engagement with materiality and form. Working primarily with hardwoods and natural lacquer, he explores the intrinsic beauty of raw, tactile surfaces. The introduction of construction clay, a typically discarded material, adds a compelling conceptual and textural dimension to his work. Through this transformation, Vincent elevates the overlooked, crafting objects of quiet elegance and desire. For further information on pricing and availability for Louis’ work, please contact info@goldenearthstudio.co.uk Artworks Wall Panel by Louis Vincent Plate by Louis Vincent Conical Bowl by Louis Vincent Bowl by Louis Vincent Wall Panel by Louis Vincent Back to Artists Bespoke Commissions Golden Earth Studio offers a bespoke commission service that utilises the construction byproducts of our clients’ homes. To explore the possibilities of commissioning a unique piece of artwork to compliments your interior space, get in touch via our contact form or email. info@goldenearthstudio.co.uk First & Last Name Email Phone Message Send",
