  "referenceHtml": "\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"2952\" class=\"elementor elementor-2952\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-88c502c e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"88c502c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-df6c749 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"df6c749\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-01d9285 animated-slow elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"01d9285\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeIn&quot;,&quot;_animation_delay&quot;:200}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"68\" data-end=\"520\">Louis Vincent’s studio practice is defined by a profound engagement with materiality and form. Working primarily with hardwoods and natural lacquer, he explores the intrinsic beauty of raw, tactile surfaces. The introduction of construction clay, a typically discarded material, adds a compelling conceptual and textural dimension to his work. Through this transformation, Vincent elevates the overlooked, crafting objects of quiet elegance and desire.</p><p data-start=\"522\" data-end=\"640\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">For further information on pricing and availability for Louis’ work, please contact<br><br data-start=\"605\" data-end=\"608\"><strong data-start=\"608\" data-end=\"640\" data-is-last-node=\"\"><a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"638\">info@goldenearthstudio.